"""Beta v2.1 C1 dual-T4 ranking warm-up (split LR, higher ranking weight).

Weights are the 2e-5 forecast probe best_model only (chart Seg155,
weighted_forecast_loss 2.31236787, local segment 26) in folder
beta_v2_1_c1_dual_t4_wc. Not v13 ranking weights, not any last_state,
not the pretrained parent. AdamW is fresh. Split trunk/head LR on
(phase-1 pattern): trunk predictor LR 1e-6, aux heads / condition LR
1e-5. warmup_constant with ratio 0.05; trunk holds 1e-6, heads warm
from 1e-6 to 1e-5 then hold. No cosine. Do not freeze the trunk.
Aux/ranking on with ranking weight 0.5 (10x the default 0.05). Same-day
stocks share a batch; coverage_order seed 20261002 is not date-sorted.
Best metric is ranking_loss (lower better), not weighted_forecast_loss
and not beta_v21_score. Forecast loss stays in the step and is still
logged. Cap 30 segments. Runtime cap 10800s (3h); time is the binding
cap.

SwanLab id is beta_v2_1_c1_dual_t4_rank_warm. Do not reuse the prior
ranking boards (suffixes rank / rank_1e5) or the forecast-best wc board.

Segment offset 0. Fresh coverage pass from chart Seg1. Same shuffle
(seed 20261002). Do not continue the v13 chart offset.
"""

